ot;Euphemia UCAS&quot;;\">ひなあいで<ruby>出<rt>だ</rt></ruby>していただいた<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>です！</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><font face=\"Euphemia UCAS\"><ruby>実<rt>じつ</rt></ruby>はもう1<ruby>匹<rt>ひき</rt></ruby><ruby>後<rt>うし</rt></ruby>ろにいるんです(*^^*)</font></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Euphemia UCAS&quot;;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Euphemia UCAS&quot;;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>明日<rt>あした</rt></ruby>はみくにちゃんです〜！</span><span class=\"s2\">(</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Menlo-Regular;\">◜ᴗ◝</span><span class=\"s2\">&nbsp;)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>最後<rt>さいご</rt></ruby>まで<ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>んでくださりありがとうございました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">では、またね</span><span class=\"s4\">🐷</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby><ruby>陽<rt>よう</rt></ruby><ruby>世<rt>よ</rt></ruby>でした</span><span class=\"s4\">👋🏻</span></p></div>\n                    ",
